<title>USA: Tests of Hondo Colombia well delayed.</title>
<headline>Tests of Hondo Colombia well delayed.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hondo Oil &amp; Gas Co said Wednesday conclusion of the testing of the Opon No. 6 well will be delayed for reasons related to the mechanical completion of the well.</p>
<p>Hondo owns an interest in the well located at the Opon Contract area in the Middle Magdalena Valley of Colombia. Amoco Corp is the operator.</p>
<p>The evaluation of the completion and any corrective action necessary may take up to six weeks, Hondo said, adding it will make public additional information about the well when it is available. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
